  "bodyHash": "i/rPqVDWiAg=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 的模組。滿懷愛心製作。眾多活躍模組支援 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「消失前的蛋孵化」是一款簡潔可設定的模組，讓地面上的雞蛋在即將消失前孵化。預設情況下，新生成的雞上限為 50 隻，以防止無限繁殖。物品（和雞蛋）在 6000 刻（5 分鐘）後消失。預設下，雞蛋只有在乾草塊上消失時才會孵化，以避免已載入區塊中野生雞群過度增長。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>eggOnlyHatchesWhenOnTopOfHayBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，雞蛋只有在乾草塊上時才會孵化。這可防止野生雞群在您不知情的情況下擴散。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>eggWillHatchChance</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 1.0，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在實體數量限制未啟動時，雞蛋在消失前孵化的機率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>onlyHatchIfLessChickensAroundThan</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 50，最小值 0，最大值 1000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">防止太多實體孵化。只有在半徑「radiusEntityLimiterCheck」範圍內雞的數量少於此設定值時，消失的雞蛋才會孵化。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>radiusEntityLimiterCheck</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 32，最小值 1，最大值 256</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">用於「onlyHatchIfLessChickensAroundThan」的檢查半徑，以消失雞蛋為中心。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>newHatchlingIsBaby</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，新孵化的雞會是小雞。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>（範例中將消失計時器設定為 1 秒）</em></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/despawning-eggs-hatch/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可自由在任何模組包中使用此模組，只要下載連結仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台上。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多獨立模組頁面中追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
